I have started the new project ideas page:

https://www.linuxfoundation.org/en/Google_Summer_of_Code_2009

Please have a look at it and edit it: Review and improve the existing 
entries and add your own ideas. The more and the better ideas we have, 
the higher the chances for us to get accepted as a mentoring 
organization in the Google Summer of Code 2009!

